---
source: crates/moa-view/tests/help.rs
expression: "debug_lines(&help::build(&data, &ctx, 80))"
---
[head*]Ctrl-a keys
[head]  c      [text]go to the console panel
[head]  t      [text]the sessions tree: every session, by group
[head]  p      [text]the big picture: what every session is doing
[head]  g      [text]the agent spot: the session open in the cockpit
[head]  /      [text]find a session: type part of its name, Enter jumps
[head]  s      [text]find a session in a full tab: type part of its name, Enter jumps
[head]  n      [text]start a new session
[head]  $      [text]a plain terminal in a new tab (for a dev server…), in the folder of the
[text]         [text]agent or session you're on; `exit` closes it
[head]  |      [text]split the agent or terminal tab you're on: a shell beside it, in the
[text]         [text]same folder; `exit` closes it
[head]  -      [text]split the agent or terminal tab you're on: a shell below it, in the
[text]         [text]same folder; `exit` closes it
[head]  m      [text]back to moa's cockpit, from an agent's own tab
[head]  z      [text]zoom the panel or split you're on to the whole tab (again to unzoom)
[head]  1      [text]switch to the cockpit layout
[head]  2      [text]switch to the focus layout
[head]  3      [text]switch to the classic layout
[head]  4      [text]switch to the triage layout
[head]  r      [text]restart any of moa's panels that stopped
[head]  Space  [text]the full menu (or Ctrl-a twice): every key here by name, with new
[text]         [text]session, layouts and repair
[head]  ←↑↓→   [text]move to the panel or split that way (or h j k l); tap more arrows right
[text]         [text]after to keep moving
[head]  [      [text]the previous tab
[head]  ]      [text]the next tab
[head]  ?      [text]this help: every key moa has
[head]  a      [text]a real Ctrl-a for the app (start of line)
[dim]
[head*]tmux's prefix (Ctrl-b unless you changed it)
[text]  [text]Space menu · m back to moa · C repair
[dim]
[head*]In every panel
[text]  [text]j/k ↑↓ move · g/G top/bottom · PgUp/PgDn · ⏎ or a click acts · the wheel
[text]  [text]scrolls · Ctrl-c cancels a prompt
[text]  [text]hold Shift to select text
[dim]
[head*]Each panel's own keys
[head]  ▤ sessions: [text]⏎/click open · n new · + group · m move · r rename · D del group ·
[text]              [text]a archive · x close
[head]  ◷ big picture: [text]⏎/click jump · d done · x drop · a archive · n/N new
[head]  ◉ status: [text]⏎/click jump · j/k · a archive · x close · n/N new · Ctrl-a / find
[head]  ☀ today: [text]j/k · ⏎ open · y/n suggestion · a archive · x close · n/N new
[head]  ▦ projects: [text]⏎ expand · a archive · x close · n new session · N choose account
[head]  ≡ activity: [text]j/k scroll
[head]  ◫ picture: [text]1-6/tab · j/k · ⏎ open · n/N new · a archive · x close · y/n
[text]             [text]suggestion · q quit
[dim]
[head*]Layouts
[head]  ▸ 1 cockpit: [text]tree · console · plan
[head]    2 focus: [text]tree · plan · agent · console
[head]    3 classic: [text]console · plan · tree
[head]    4 triage: [text]status · console · plan
[text]  [text]see one: moa layout show NAME
[text]  [text]change one: moa layout set NAME JSON
[dim]
[head*]Agent states
[warn*]  ! needs you
[ask*]  ? asks you
[fail*]  ✗ failed
[ok*]  ✓ done
[work]  ⠸ working
[quiet]  ◌ quiet
[dim]  ● idle
